Modifications: added CommerceArbiter coded tools and CommerceBoundary middleware;
replaced search execution with a deterministic local catalogue; disabled private
sly_data propagation to external networks; bounded execution; provided replay
and live model configurations. All original instruction strings and network
connections are preserved. scripts/build_networks.py regenerates both variants.

Airbnb, Expedia, Booking.com, Macy's, CarMax and LinkedIn names identify the copied
example networks. This demo is not affiliated with those businesses, uses no
business booking APIs, and never transfers real money or makes real reservations.
